re_034=1 stratum than in the complement. However, the interval crosses zero and includes clinically meaningful null/negative effects, so it cannot be accepted from discovery evidence alone. I therefore leave H31 unresolved/active and request independent validation. H32, the analogous interaction for outcome_014, has a smaller and much less precise signed estimate, +0.0247 with CI -0.0391 to +0.0886, so I defer it rather than use scarce validation resources on two correlated interaction tests. All conclusions remain association statements in the supplied dataset; no causal or generalizability claim is being made.",
