aningful predictor-outcome association or effect modification is supported. Validation was not requested because no voluntary validation budget remains. The supported dataset-internal landscape remains unchanged and narrow: feature_021=1 versus 0 with less-negative outcome_006, and feature_027=1 versus 0 with less-negative outcome_014. These remain noncausal associations and do not establish marker identity, mechanism, therapeutic relevance, or external generalizability. Their implausibly large magnitude also warrants caution about leakage, coding artifacts, latent batch effects, or subtype structure if raw-data inspection were available.",
